From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:22:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] indexeddb: Abort a transaction whose commit failed with the
 backend's error

A failed commit aborted the transaction with an OperationError,
whatever the backend reported. Now that the backend's commit result is
the result of COMMIT itself, script aborts with the backend's error
mapped as for other backend failures: QuotaExceededError when the disk
or the database is full, OperationError otherwise, as step 2.4 of
"commit a transaction" asks ("for example a QuotaExceededError or an
UnknownError DOMException"; Servo has no UnknownError). The
OperationError's message says that the commit failed, rather than the
open-failed message of the mapping.

idbtransaction.rs has one Error without a message fewer, so tidy's
allowance for it in error_message_exceptions.txt goes down to 6.

Validation: `./mach build --release` with SpiderMonkey and with `--js-engine quickjs`, and the DAYU200 board build, succeed at the tip of the series. WPT IndexedDB/ at the tip of the series (with the P1 review fixes), passing subtests of 4,511: host SpiderMonkey 3,251 with no unexpected result, host QuickJS 3,253, DAYU200 in the board configuration (QuickJS + RDB) 3,247 (before the series 3,224, 3,229 and 3,222). `./mach test-tidy` reports only the libsqlite3-sys advisory (deny.toml:434), as before the series. No WPT test makes COMMIT fail, so none depends on this change; the backend side, a failed COMMIT reaching the commit callback as an error, is covered by test_failed_commit_reports_the_error_and_rolls_back and test_commit_failure_rolls_back.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; the agent wrote the change, checked it with the WPT runs of the series, and changed the error message for the P1 review)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .../script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs     | 18 +++++++++++++-----
 python/tidy/error_message_exceptions.txt       |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs b/components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs
index 2204245f811..36e7736ffb8 100644
--- a/components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs
+++ b/components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs
@@ -332,15 +332,23 @@ impl IDBTransaction {
                     Ok(()) => {
                         this.finalize_commit();
                     }
-                    Err(_err) => {
-                         // TODO: Map backend commit/rollback failure to an appropriate DOMException
-                        this.initiate_abort(cx, Error::Operation(None));
+                    Err(err) => {
+                        // https://w3c.github.io/IndexedDB/#commit-a-transaction
+                        // Step 2.4. If an error occurs while writing the changes to the database,
+                        // then run abort a transaction with transaction and an appropriate type
+                        // for the error, for example a QuotaExceededError or an "UnknownError"
+                        // DOMException, and terminate these steps.
+                        let error = match err {
+                            BackendError::DbErr(details) => Error::Operation(Some(format!(
+                                "IndexedDB commit failed: {details}"
+                            ))),
+                            other => map_backend_error_to_dom_error(other),
+                        };
+                        this.initiate_abort(cx, error);
 
                         this.finalize_abort();
                     }
                 }
-                // TODO: https://w3c.github.io/IndexedDB/#commit-a-transaction
-                // Backend commit/rollback is not yet atomic.
             }));
         })
         .expect("Could not create callback");
diff --git a/python/tidy/error_message_exceptions.txt b/python/tidy/error_message_exceptions.txt
index 62d2a30d369..4b9b6fa97b5 100644
--- a/python/tidy/error_message_exceptions.txt
+++ b/python/tidy/error_message_exceptions.txt
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 ./components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbobjectstore.rs 26
 ./components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbopendbrequest.rs 1
 ./components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbrequest.rs 7
-./components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs 7
+./components/script/dom/indexeddb/idbtransaction.rs 6
 ./components/script/dom/indexeddb/key.rs 2
 ./components/script/dom/intersectionobserver/intersectionobserver.rs 2
 ./components/script/dom/macros.rs 2
